OL,3,GNEWSASecond scenic Highland rail route
OL,4,Ato close for upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second scenic route in the Highlands
OL,7,Fis to close for an upgrade and repair
OL,8,Fprogramme.
OL,10,FThe line between Dingwall and Kyle of
OL,11,FLochalsh will be shut for a period of
OL,12,Fthree weeks starting at the end of
OL,13,FNovember.
OL,15,FA number of different locations will
OL,16,Fsee improvements made including the
OL,17,FCarron Viaduct and upgrade work will
OL,18,Falso be done at Inverness railway
OL,19,Fstation.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
