OL,3,GNEWSASecond scenic Highland rail route
OL,4,Ato close for upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe #9m overhaul is being carried out a
OL,7,Fcouple of weeks after the West Highland
OL,8,FLine is shut for nine days in order to
OL,9,Fmake it more resilient in periods of
OL,10,Fbad weather.
